1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:04,590
(Leonard:)Oh. You had a party
for your 60th?

2
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:06,890
(Beverley:)Oh, I wouldn't call it a party.

3
00:00:06,892 --> 00:00:08,862
(Beverley:)Just a few close friends.

4
00:00:10,263 --> 00:00:12,233
(Beverley:)And your sister and brother.

5
00:00:14,767 --> 00:00:16,997
(Penny:)You know, to be fair,
we did get married in Vegas

6
00:00:17,003 --> 00:00:18,033
(Penny:)and didn't invite her.

7
00:00:18,037 --> 00:00:20,937
(Beverley:)And I never did thank you
for that, dear.

8
00:00:23,542 --> 00:00:25,342
(ringtone plays)
AMY: Oh.

9
00:00:25,344 --> 00:00:28,344
(Amy:)Penny says everyone's there.
Are you ready?

10
00:00:28,347 --> 00:00:30,947
(takes deep breath)
I am.

11
00:00:38,291 --> 00:00:40,561
(Sheldon:)Oh. Wait.
Are you all right?

12
00:00:40,559 --> 00:00:43,399
(Sheldon:)No, I just...
I got a little light-headed.

13
00:00:43,396 --> 00:00:44,826
Oh, d-do you need a minute?

14
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:46,960
(exhales)
No.

15
00:00:46,966 --> 00:00:49,296
(Sheldon:)No, if I can walk
past that pet shop

16
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,732
(Sheldon:)with the parrot in the window,
I suppose I can do this.

17
00:00:57,677 --> 00:01:00,147
OTHERS:
Happy birthday!

